response:
The report describes a targeted cyberattack tracked under identifier UAC-0098. Threat actors distributed phishing emails carrying a malicious XLS attachment titled "Військові на Азовсталі.xls". When opened, the macro downloads and runs "pe.dll", a library packed with a crypter associated with the TrickBot cybercrime group. This leads to the execution of Cobalt Strike Beacon (notevil.dll). The report also references a previous advisory CERT-UA#4464 regarding "spisok.exe" and lists network IOCs including 138.68.229.0 and dezword.com.

